WEBVTT

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:05.110
Alice!

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.800
Maybe she isn't going to work, after all.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.340
Alice, what's wrong?

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:16.870
What happened?

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.490
Alice, sing!

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:19.790
Sing, Alice!

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.290
<i>I've already decided.</i>

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:23.480
Alice!

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.950
<i>No matter how much time it takes...</i>

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:25.290
Alice!

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.670
<i>I will be your friend.</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.160
<i>I swear</i>

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:33.850
<i>I will.</i>

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.850
What was that?

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.860
Wh-What? A k-kiss.

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:53.350
Why? Western greeting?

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:55.280
Huh? No.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:57.470
Western greeting?

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:59.680
I said it wasn't! Don't you get it?

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.610
Then what did it mean—

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:03.330
Isn't it obvious?!

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.290
Nino-chan!

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.890
What's the matter? What are 
you two doing on the floor?

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:13.300
Do you feel sick?

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.550
I'm okay.

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:16.730
Really?

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:18.550
You don't need to push yourself.

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:21.510
I have to sing the rest.

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:26.120
That so? Okay! Then I'll let them know.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:28.010
Come on over after you've rested a bit.

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:31.600
A-Alice...

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:34.120
Yuzu, don't talk to me for a while.

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.080
<i>How is this</i>

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:44.980
<i>protecting her smile?</i>

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:21.220
♭09 And So, We Took Off Running for That Summer

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:27.410
<i>That was... That kiss means...</i>

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:31.130
<i>Just as I've liked Momo all this time,</i>

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:35.230
<i>Yuzu has feelings for...</i>

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:40.610
All right, cut!

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:43.620
Queen, your pinky finger's 
sticking out. Watch it!

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:45.120
Oh, gosh!

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:48.000
All right! Take five!

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.600
Hey, Yana. It's crazy to expect 
this to be done in two weeks.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.870
Sorry! But we're counting on you!

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:57.630
Guess I've got no choice but to get it done!

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:05.120
Yuzu, don't talk to me for a while.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:25.260
What's up? You seem kinda down.

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:26.570
I do?

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:31.100
Nino-chan really gave it 
her all at the recording.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:35.330
We got a good recording, and the 
music video's coming along great, too.

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:39.270
<i>I have to apologize to Alice.</i>

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:40.840
<i>But...</i>

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:46.590
He's so mad all the time.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:48.010
I know. It even wears me out.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.510
It's fun, though, so it's all good.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:57.900
Haruyoshi-senpai, you were 
sticking out your pinky too much.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.360
A-Alice!

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:05.360
U-Um, about the other day...

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.530
Hey, Arisugawa.

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:47.420
Could you take Yuzuriha's 
bag to the nurse's office?

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:55.840
Alice?!

00:05:55.840 --> 00:06:00.130
The teacher told me you were 
feeling sick and left early.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:03.570
I-I'm fine. It's just a cold or something.

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.610
Go home or you'll catch it.

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:07.120
I brought your bag.

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.740
Thanks. Now, go home.

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:10.660
No.

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:14.010
Go! Weren't you the one who 
told me not to talk to you?

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:17.520
But I'm worried.

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:25.860
Yuzu.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:26.700
What?

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.320
I'm going to quit In NO Hurry.

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.870
I've been thinking all this time

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.080
that it'd be better if I quit.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:41.080
Yuzu, I'm sorry.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:45.780
I never noticed how you felt about me.

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.470
I just kept taking advantage of you.

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:53.270
When I thought that I've been 
walking all over your feelings,

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.180
I felt so sad,

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.970
and so frustrated...

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:01.320
I just couldn't look you in the eye.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.840
And when we were on <i>Music King</i>, 
and then during recording,

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:09.350
I was so preoccupied with Momo 
that I nearly ruined everything.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:14.740
They happened to work out, but I don't think 
coincidences like that can go on forever.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:18.090
If I'm just going to keep on hurting you,

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:20.750
then I can't stay with In NO Hurry.

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:25.680
I don't even know where 
I should aim when I sing.

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:28.010
I don't deserve

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:29.710
to be Alice.

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:51.110
Wh-Why are you laughing?

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:53.840
Come on, Alice.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:54.820
Don't tell me...

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:59.370
you thought I liked you or something?

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.160
You don't?

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:02.870
No way.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:04.490
Anyway, let's go.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.880
Huh? Where?

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.060
Just come.

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:11.260
I'm pretty sure it starts today.

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:17.830
What's happening in Shibuya?

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:19.810
Yuzu...

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:21.810
Here it comes.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.120
<i>Fly!</i>

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:47.280
Oh, it's In NO Hurry.

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:48.630
I like this one.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.630
<i>Whether I'm awake or asleep I sing</i>

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.870
<i>I'm nothing more than a canary</i>

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:01.980
<i>Drowning in sweet, glistening lies</i>

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.600
Alice, have you ever noticed?

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:04.990
<i>Whether I'm awake or asleep, I peck</i>

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:06.890
You always sing toward the sky.

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:07.320
<i>I'm not afraid of anything</i>

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:12.330
<i>I sleep in the depths of sweet nectar</i>

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:18.240
<i>When I sing, that alone makes me wonderful</i>

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:22.010
<i>So let me stay in this cage</i>

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:21.190
Even if you're stripped of everything,

00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:23.760
whether you're sad or frustrated,

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:28.460
<i>When I shout, that alone makes me invincible</i>

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:25.750
or heartbroken.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:32.320
No matter what happens, you'll never 
give up, and you'll keep on singing.

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:32.620
<i>So please don't open this cage</i>

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:34.380
Aiming for Momo.

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:37.180
<i>I'll fall</i>

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.110
And that's fine, Alice.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.700
That voice of yours is what we...

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:43.570
<i>Straight down</i>

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:42.260
What everyone here is so captivated by.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.920
That's why I asked you to join In NO Hurry.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:48.810
<i>I'm being swallowed by waves 
of what is real and empty</i>

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.990
When I said to you, "Isn't it obvious?"

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:50.680
I meant, isn't it obvious that 
your voice is precious to us?

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:53.820
<i>My chocolate, milk, candy, and 
everything else is being taken away</i>

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:56.030
That's why, back then, when I was afraid 
you'd ruin your voice by screaming,

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.360
I did what I did.

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:00.420
But really, whatever the reason...

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:02.120
I'm sorry.

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:05.770
Really?

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:07.330
<i>As I'm carried away by the flow, I awaken</i>

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.500
<i>My name is Canary</i>

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:10.360
Yuzu.

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:14.210
<i>All the sweet lies are empty</i>

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:16.550
Didn't I tell you we were friends?

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.650
<i>As I'm carried away by the flow, I am plucked</i>

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:19.910
<i>And now I'm left with no more feathers</i>

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:20.930
That's true.

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:25.030
<i>I fall deeper into the depths of 
the sweet darkness of the night</i>

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:23.930
You finally smiled.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.940
<i>I would have been fine...</i>

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:46.060
<i>Ever since then,</i>

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:49.540
<i>whenever I touch this guitar, I feel like 
something's caught in my throat.</i>

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:56.580
<i>Yuzu said I'm fine as I am,</i>

00:10:57.220 --> 00:11:00.750
<i>but I feel like, no matter how much 
I sing, I haven't sung at all.</i>

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:04.350
<i>I know I'd be better off letting 
this go sooner than later.</i>

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:06.850
<i>I should let go.</i>

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:13.060
<i>It's Yana.</i>

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:16.110
<i>We're going to be performing the same 
day as the black cats at Rock Horizon.</i>

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:17.560
<i>I'll call back later.</i>

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:24.700
Incoming Call 
Eyelashes

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:26.850
Yes? Hello?

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:28.540
<i>Good morning, Momo.</i>

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:29.360
<i>It's me.</i>

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:31.710
<i>I want to talk to you about something.</i>

00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:39.240
You look down, Haruyoshi-senpai.

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:43.210
I was listening to our recent practice. 
Something feels lacking.

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:45.470
Something's lacking?

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:48.620
It's like it doesn't really 
hit home, or something.

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:51.600
Like everything within me 
still isn't reaching you.

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.370
So you've started longing for me?

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:57.580
I've always longed for you.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:01.030
Gosh! Listen to your jokes!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.610
Too bad, though.

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:06.150
I decided to use the In NO Hurry that 
tossed me aside as a stepping stone

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:08.450
to soar higher than ever before.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:10.700
A stepping stone?

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:19.340
<i>It resonates</i>

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:22.170
<i>Even in my dreams</i>

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:25.540
<i>My soul and my heart are shaken</i>

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.630
<i>This isn't right.</i>

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:26.850
<i>My voice isn't coming out at all.</i>

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:27.580
<i>By your song</i>

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:33.530
<i>I can't wait until Wednesday</i>

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:30.350
Kuro.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.710
Why is she singing such an old song?

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:36.210
<i>Right now, it's everything</i>

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:38.660
Nino-chan said she wanted to make 
complete copies of all our songs.

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:39.000
<i>My everything</i>

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.560
<i>I don't need anything else</i>

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:42.190
She sounds like she's hit a bit of a wall,

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.970
<i>Hurry and wake me up</i>

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.970
so I asked if she wanted any help.

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:46.290
But she keeps insisting that she's fine.

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:49.900
I guess she really wants to get 
a hold of the genuine "Alice"

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:51.250
deep inside her.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.460
<i>I guess I really should return 
this guitar to Kuze-san.</i>

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:08.560
<i>Momo!</i>

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.060
<i>Kuze-san.</i>

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:17.560
<i>I already had a feeling.</i>

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:21.570
<i>She's the person Momo likes right now.</i>

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:27.820
Huh? Aren't you going home, Momo?

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:31.010
No, I said I'd meet someone.

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:33.950
So he actually has friends.

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:36.460
I can hear you.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.300
You're early.

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:43.850
What'd you want to talk about?

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:45.760
My CDs.

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:47.260
Huh?

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:49.810
I loaned you two of my CDs, didn't I?

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:51.680
I really like those.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.020
Are you just gonna keep them?

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:57.020
I thought you'd never talk to me again.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:00.740
I mean, aren't you In NO Hurry's Cheshire?

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:03.030
Huh? H-How did you know?

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:05.570
And In NO Hurry's vocalist is Alice.

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:08.030
Your nickname for Nino is Alice.

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:10.990
In NO Hurry is a band you made for Nino.

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:12.530
Am I wrong?

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:18.260
You know I'm Kiryuu Momo, don't you?

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:23.120
Once you knew that, I thought 
you'd never come near me again.

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:25.010
And I planned to keep my distance, too.

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.010
Why?

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:32.340
Because you stole Nino's voice.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:40.780
<i>I can't.</i>

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.820
<i>I just can't do it.</i>

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:46.820
<i>Even though Yuzu went to the trouble 
to make a place for me to sing,</i>

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:48.820
<i>I can't sing if this goes on.</i>

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.490
<i>I have to forget Momo.</i>

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.330
<i>I have to give up on Momo.</i>

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.330
<i>This guitar is just...</i>

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:00.120
<i>But...</i>

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:01.880
<i>But!</i>

00:15:02.020 --> 00:15:02.750
<i>But!</i>

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:03.810
<i>But!</i>

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:06.680
<i>I can't throw it away.</i>

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.200
<i>How could I let it go?</i>

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:12.510
<i>My voice moved his heart,</i>

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.010
<i>and it's my only proof of that.</i>

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:19.640
<i>I'll sing.</i>

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:21.150
<i>With this guitar.</i>

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:22.720
<i>I'll sing.</i>

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:25.150
<i>With everything that I am.</i>

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:27.100
<i>I'll shout it out!</i>

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:41.420
<i>Whether I'm awake or asleep, I sing</i>

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.780
<i>I'm nothing more than a canary</i>

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:48.760
<i>Drowning in sweet, glistening lies</i>

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:46.570
<i>More and more!</i>

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.310
<i>I'll shout with all I have!</i>

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:50.520
<i>I have to shout it all out!</i>

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:51.760
<i>Whether I'm awake of asleep, I peck</i>

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.130
<i>I'm not afraid of anything</i>

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:54.120
<i>It's not enough.</i>

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:59.230
<i>I sleep in the depths of sweet nectar</i>

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:57.430
<i>It's not nearly enough sound!</i>

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:04.890
<i>When I sing, that alone makes me wonderful</i>

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:04.720
<i>This won't reach!</i>

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:08.870
<i>So let me stay here in this cage</i>

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:15.410
<i>When I shout, that alone makes me invincible</i>

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:15.380
<i>That day, when my voice reached Momo,</i>

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:19.490
<i>So please don't open this cage</i>

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:19.670
<i>I had everyone with me. And their sound.</i>

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:24.300
<i>I'll fall</i>

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:24.600
<i>Back then, I was In NO Hurry's Alice.</i>

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:30.230
<i>Straight down</i>

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:28.930
<i>I'm Alice.</i>

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:36.010
<i>I'm being swallowed by waves 
of what is real and empty</i>

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:38.310
<i>This performance...</i>

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:46.800
<i>On that day, at that time,</i>

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:50.240
<i>it felt like my whole body 
was touched by sound.</i>

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:51.200
<i>This is the same.</i>

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:56.320
<i>I'll swallow both poison and love whole,
and open my beak wide</i>

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:02.960
Nino's voice is the only light I have.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:07.960
If I didn't have her voice, I'm sure 
I wouldn't be alive right now.

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:12.620
I've been able to come this far because 
of my memories of singing with her.

00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:15.760
Once I took care of everything,

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:18.460
and if Nino was still singing at that time,

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:22.390
I had planned to find her and 
sing together with her again.

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:26.400
To tell her I wanted her to sing the 
songs that I had written for her.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:30.400
Doesn't that mean you really do like her?

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:34.900
This feeling is more precious than that.

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:38.110
One day, I will take her back from you.

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:42.660
Her voice belongs only to me.

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:45.150
Alice's voice...

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.030
Her voice, at least...

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:50.290
belongs only to me!

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:56.380
We'll settle this at Rock Horizon.

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:57.890
I'll turn the tables.

00:17:58.240 --> 00:18:00.390
I'll never hand over Alice!

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:06.390
That's all.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.630
See you later, Sakaki.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:15.310
See you later, Eyelashes.

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:29.740
That was the best you've ever sung.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:34.640
My voice alone was no good. 
It wasn't enough.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:40.050
So I used everyone's... In NO Hurry's sound.

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:43.060
So you had always been 
singing alone before now?

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.060
Yes.

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:48.560
I see. So that's why.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:53.650
This is the first time you weren't 
just thinking of yourself.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:56.220
You were thinking of all 
of us as you sang this time.

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:59.070
That's why it reached me.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:02.030
I-It reached you?

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:06.450
Yep. It looks like that guitar 
could be your weapon.

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:10.720
Momo's guitar could be my weapon?

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:14.560
Tha... Thank you.

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:21.180
I-I'll use this to go after the 
person who dumped me again.

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:27.290
Seriously? You really need 
to learn when to give up.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.520
Yeah...

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.190
You're just like me.

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:35.360
I always felt there was something 
about you that bothered me.

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:37.460
I thought this wasn't In NO Hurry

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:40.650
if Miou wasn't a part of it.

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:44.520
But I remembered after 
hearing you sing just now.

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:48.120
You're the one who started In NO Hurry.

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:52.670
Six years ago, when Yuzu's mother 
cut him off from music,

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:57.470
he could finally breathe again 
when he had you sing for him.

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:00.670
<i>Yuzu's the same as me?</i>

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:04.150
It's because you were there 
that In NO Hurry was born.

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:10.430
And I just wanted to play Yuzu's 
sound for the same reason.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:16.340
Yuzu, Miou, Kuro, and me...

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:19.440
We all have something that 
makes us not want to give up.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.980
So it doesn't matter how 
bad it makes you look.

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:24.480
Let's all struggle as long as we can.

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:31.120
Welcome to In NO Hurry,

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:32.770
Alice.

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:45.830
I'm home.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.560
I give up.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:54.600
Just when I thought he wouldn't 
finish any new songs for Baby.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.560
Look how many songs are here.

00:20:57.060 --> 00:21:01.570
He's been writing up until 
now for her alone? Sheesh.

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:06.200
You looked so desperate that 
I thought you might give up,

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.580
but unfortunately, your sound doesn't lie.

00:21:10.780 --> 00:21:13.080
You still like her so much,
you can't help yourself.

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:15.400
Nino-chan, I mean.

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:20.050
<i>On this week's singles chart,</i>

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:21.630
<i>number two is...</i>

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:24.090
<i>"Canary" by In NO Hurry to Shout.</i>

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:25.270
So close!

00:21:25.270 --> 00:21:26.050
Rats!

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:29.280
I guess that means Baby is 
number one again this week.

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:30.560
That's so frustrating!

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:34.920
It's okay. I have a feeling Baby 
will fall off the map next year.

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:37.090
You say some scary things 
with a smile on your face!

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:38.060
I thought

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:41.030
we were going to wait until we had
an album to take number one.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:46.500
You sure know how to say it, Ninocchi!

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:49.350
Kuro! Your happy drumming 
is annoying! Cut it out!

00:21:49.350 --> 00:21:52.290
So what song are we starting 
our practice with today?

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:55.660
I see you're not listening, as usual, Alice.

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:01.550
Okay, let's start.

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:03.870
<i>But, Yuzu...</i>

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:06.100
<i>I was really happy!</i>

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:07.550
<i>Thanks.</i>

00:22:08.610 --> 00:22:10.550
<i>For giving me a place to sing.</i>

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:13.560
<i>I don't just want to sing 
so I can reach Momo.</i>

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:15.240
<i>I want to give back, too.</i>

00:22:18.840 --> 00:22:23.890
<i>Haruyoshi-senpai, Miou, Kuro-kun, Yuzu.</i>

00:22:25.610 --> 00:22:28.780
<i>I want to take all the things you treasure,</i>

00:22:30.180 --> 00:22:31.470
<i>hold them close,</i>

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:33.080
<i>and sing.</i>

00:22:33.910 --> 00:22:37.250
<i>More than anyone else. 
Stronger than anyone else.</i>

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:41.870
<i>And so, we took off running</i>

00:22:42.990 --> 00:22:44.540
<i>for that summer.</i>

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:52.100
♭10 
The One Who Lit a Fire Inside Alice Was Me
